{
  "name": "Daily Reconciliation Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔍 DAILY RECONCILIATION MONITOR\n**What it does:** Every morning it reads yesterday's rows from your source sheet and your destination sheet → compares them on a key field → flags MISSING_IN_DESTINATION, EXTRA_IN_DESTINATION and MISMATCHED rows (numeric fields compared with a tolerance) → logs every break + the run status to a Run Log sheet → AI classifies each mismatch cause → Telegram summary.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials (sheets.google.com)\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n\n**Status flow in the Run Log:** `NEW` → `COMPARING` → `BREAK_FOUND` (one row per break) → `REPORTED` → `DONE`",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 4740,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ede6d6d2-4bbd-4ca8-a8a6-84661e2f60bd",
